This product includes software developed as a reference implementation
of the AFS (Audio Fingerprint Sync) specification.

---

This product includes or depends on the following third-party works:

Chromaprint
  Used via the fpcalc binary (CLI tools) and, in the browser demo, via
  a WebAssembly build that is loaded as a separate .wasm module at
  runtime. Chromaprint is required to generate and verify the
  fingerprints described by the AFS spec.
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (LGPL-2.1)
  Source:  https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint
  Notice:  The LGPL-2.1 permits use of Chromaprint as a library in this
           project. Users who wish to substitute a modified version of
           Chromaprint may replace the fpcalc binary on their PATH or
           the .wasm file shipped under demo/vendor/.

smol-toml
  Bundled in demo/vendor/smol-toml/ and used by the browser demo to
  parse AFS file headers.
  License: MIT
  Source:  https://github.com/squirrelchat/smol-toml
  Notice:  The MIT license text is preserved alongside the vendored
           source files.

qrcode-generator
  Bundled in demo/vendor/qrcode-generator/ and used by the browser
  demo to display QR codes for sharing demo URLs.
  License: MIT
  Source:  https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator
  Notice:  The MIT license text is preserved alongside the vendored
           source files.
